Art demo: 2754 assertions passed. Articulated source-pixel heroes, 3 stages, 5 common monsters, 2 elites, mirrors, aspect-preserving 80/100/120% output, projectiles, transparent shatter and GDI ownership. skeleton=monster-guardian; slime=monster-slime; imp=monster-imp; bat=monster-bat; mushroom=monster-mushroom; boss/elite=elite-guardian; elite-mushroom, mirror-shard, mirror-wraith and mirror-boss use dedicated illustrations. Weapons: spear=weapon-mortal; greatsword=weapon-zhuji; laser=weapon-qishi; wave=weapon-wave; boomerang=weapon-moonring; blackhole=weapon-array; automaton=weapon-talisman. Hero identity follows cultivation stage independently.
